{
  "description": "the audited site's card declares its /mcp, which answers every POST with a 401 naming same-host root RFC 9728 metadata that names it, and the metadata read at a nonsense path draws a 503: the card already made the endpoint of record, so an echo read that got no answer leaves sign-in settled, the rows the 401s answer read auth-required, and none reads broken",
